  "sangamTamil": "பெருநடை தாம்பெறினும் பெற்றி பிழையா\nதொருநடைய ராகுவர் சான்றோர் - பெருநடை\nபெற்றக் கடைத்தும் பிறங்கருவி நன்னாட\nவற்றாம் ஒருநடை கீழ்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Promotion does not spoil the good nor improve the bad Lord of the goodly land of swelling torrents! If thoroughly worthy men gain some added dignity, their nature knows no deviation, but they go on in the same even path of virtue ; and although the base obtain promotion, his conduct too changes not, (promotion betters him not.)",
